tine retains only the local, terminal-autocomplete functionality (the native
macOS suggestion window and the Fig-spec autocomplete engine). The Amazon Q
AI/chat, cloud service clients, authentication, telemetry, dashboard,
pseudo-terminal, input method, and non-macOS platform support have been
removed.

